<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia OSK year net profit doubles.</title>
<headline>Malaysia OSK year net profit doubles.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 136.45   vs	  57.02</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 50.98   vs	  26.75</p>
<p>    Turnover		   368.61   vs	 173.46</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   197.31   vs	  85.93</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  1.04   vs	    -</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    0.11   vs	   0.24</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	25.0    vs	   27.5</p>
<p>NOTE - OSK Holdings Bhd is mainly involved in the stockbroking business.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
